 AskForStringWithBigFont;parms;question;MyFnt;globalParms;StdFont;InputFont;LabelFont
 globalParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 parms←##.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForString
 StdFont←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Georgia')('Size' 30))
 InputFont←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Courier New')('Size' 30))
 LabelFont←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Tahoma')('Size' 24))
 parms.(fontStandard fontInput fontLabel)←StdFont InputFont LabelFont
 parms.default←'Johnny Doe'
 MyFnt←⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Tahoma')('Size' 30))
 parms.font←MyFnt
 question←''
 question,←⊂'Make sure you understand the request!'
 question,←⊂'This is a very very very very long line that defines the widths of the form'
 question,←⊂'Your full name:'
 question,←⊂''
 question,←⍕¨⍳10
 ⎕←parms globalParms ##.GUI.Request.AskForString question
⍝Done
